Query1: 
stats latest(arch) as cpu_arch, latest(instance_type) as itype, latest(disk_used_pct) as disk_pct,
      latest(mem_available_mb) as mem_mb, latest(arc_status) as arc,
      latest(needs_attention) as attention, latest(reasons) as issues by instance_id

Query2:
fields @timestamp, instance_id, arch, reasons
| filter needs_attention = "yes"
| sort @timestamp desc
